# Keep Docker build context lean — production image should not ship
# editor, test, or design-only files.

**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.dockerignore
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.cursor
**/.vs
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.classpath
**/.toolstarget

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/npm-debug.log*
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml

# Compose / Docker meta (not needed inside the image context recursively)
**/charts
**/docker-compose*
**/compose*
**/Dockerfile*

# Tests & e2e — not needed to serve the built site
cypress/
cypress.config.js
**/__tests__/
**/*.test.js
**/*.test.jsx
**/*.spec.js
**/*.spec.jsx
jest.config.js
jest.setup.js
babel.config.js

# Design / docs
BlackJack_flow.docx
LICENSE
README.md
SECURITY.md

# Unused assets
src/assets/facedown.jpg
src/assets/facedown2.jpg
src/assets/facedown3.jpg

# Generated CSS is rebuilt in the image if needed; prefer Vite dist deploy
style/output.css
